-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Shit stuff like that continues to the curret day see sports team rivalries and the \u201cConsole wars \u201c god that is so stupid ,<br /> <br /> I heard someone in the COFD thread theorizing that it was the work of the God-Machine To study physiology. Or something.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I remember back as a kid that the Raiders were my favorite football team. Not because of how well (or terribly) they played, but just because of their mascot and logo. I thought pirates were cool, so a team that modeled themselves after pirates must have been cool, too.<br /> <br /> I'm not a sports fan, if you couldn't tell... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-06T12:44:22-08:00","id":1294482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/124026-idigam-chronicles-weekly-discussion-shapeshifting?p=129441#post129441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They came out around the time of the 90's. Where everything had to be EXTREME!!!</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, I think it had more to do with the fact that the collectible monster genre was brand new at the time. None of us had seen anything like Pok\u00e9mon before, especially here in the US, so when two big IPs come out around the same time, both with this totally new (at the time) concept, naturally to our minds one had to be a rip-off of the other. A few kids were bold enough to put forth that maybe different people happened to come up with similar ideas at around the same time, and maybe each influenced the other as they were developing. But that was <i>radical</i> thinking.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/124026-idigam-chronicles-weekly-discussion-shapeshifting?p=129441#post129441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fandoms at the time were more like faction wars, than proper communities.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, that wasn\u2019t really anything new in the 90s, and it has only gotten even more extreme since then.<br /> <br /> From what I recall, Nintendo vs. Sega was a much bigger and more bitter fandom war than Pok\u00e9mon vs. Digimon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"